# Morrowind Temple: promotion to Diviner (7), which Archcanon Tholer Saryoni's duties need. Diviner asks one favored
# skill at 70, two at 25, Personality and Intelligence of 33 and reputation 80 (MorrowindRuntime's FACT table).
# SetRestoration, SetMysticism and SetAlchemy stand in for the player's training, SetPersonality and SetIntelligence
# for level-up choices; the reputation is the player's own from the duties before. As Diviner, Endryn Llethan's
# "duties" sends the player to the Archcanon with the key to his rooms (TT_DagonFel 1). The main quest's Saryoni gives
# the same key, so a player who has it hands it back first and the count is this reply's alone.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_staralor_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_diviner
run
player->SetRestoration 70
player->SetMysticism 25
player->SetAlchemy 25
player->SetPersonality 33
player->SetIntelligence 33
player->PositionCell 378 -280 3 0 "Molag Mar, Temple"
until 600 "tharer rotheloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tharer rotheloth
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Temple >= 7
bye
end

case tt_diviner_key
run
player->RemoveItem key_archcanon_private 10
player->PositionCell -1031 -150 -616 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 "endryn llethan"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk endryn llethan
ask duties
expect GetJournalIndex TT_DagonFel == 1
expect player->GetItemCount key_archcanon_private == 1
bye
end
